'''Throwing weapons''' are those [[weapon]]s which are hurled at an opponent; the force behind these weapons comes from the motion of the wielder's arm.
This classification is mostly notable in connection with a [[halfling]]'s [[good aim]] feat.

In ''Neverwinter Nights'', these weapons consist of
* [[dart]]s,
* [[shuriken]]s,
* [[sling]]s, and
* [[throwing axe]]s.
